  "statement": ": ∀ a b : ℝ, a ∈ Set.Icc 0 1 ∧ b ∈ Set.Icc 0 1 → (2 / Real.sqrt 3 - 1 / 3) ≤ (2 * a / (b + 1) + b / (3 * a + 1) + (1 - a) * (1 - b)) ∧ (2 * a / (b + 1) + b / (3 * a + 1) + (1 - a) * (1 - b)) ≤ 2 ∧ (Real.sqrt 3 - 3 / 4) ≤ (3 * a / (b + 1) + b / (2 * a + 1) + (1 - a) * (1 - b)) ∧ (3 * a / (b + 1) + b / (2 * a + 1) + (1 - a) * (1 - b)) ≤ 3",
